t always sends the full prompt, so a tokens-only stub never saves one token of prefill (restore ≡ cold by construction). The valuable form is proactive re-materialization (speculative idle-slot warming) — needs trace-measured prefix recurrence economics first; recommendation recorded, verdict is the operator's. **I4** folds into the bench binaries at the Q4 verdict (their next touch), not before — the ship-line harness stays pristine. Also caught and fixed in `tools/quiet_q4_bench.sh` + COORDINATION.md/lessons: `pgrep -f "q27-metal-server.*--port"` matches the caffeinate WRAPPER too — server pids must match argv[0] (ps+awk), or the verify-empty check lies (the orphan-double-load crash class).
